
.subckt astra_017_cmos_time_to_voltage vdd VSS integrate sample iref reset out
CH out VSS 2p
CI net0 VSS 10p
M1 iref iref vdd vdd APMOS l=2u w=10u
M10 net0 sample out VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M2 net1 iref vdd vdd APMOS l=2u w=10u
M3 net0 enb net1 vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M4 net0 reset VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=20u
M5 enb integrate vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=10u
M6 enb integrate VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=4u
M7 sampleb sample vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=10u
M8 sampleb sample VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=4u
M9 net0 sampleb out vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
RL out VSS 1g
.ends astra_017_cmos_time_to_voltage
